A union the manifest changes keeps the frozen entry order, then the entries the
stable schema has added since: frozen from a stable [a, b] whose unstable version is
[a, n, b], with a stable schema that now has [a, b, c], the union is [a, n, b, c]
(0039-PLAN-five-adopter-additions-on-schema-1-25-0.md, 2c).

